DATA LICENSES (separate from the MIT code license above)

The bundled neuron datasets in `data/` and `data-poker/` are derived from
third-party sources and are covered by their own terms:

* `data-poker/` is derived from **MaleCNS v1.0** (Janelia/FlyEM),
  licensed under **CC-BY 4.0**.
  Source: https://male-cns.janelia.org/download/
  Please cite: Berg et al., *Cell* (MaleCNS v1.0 release).
  `data-poker/` contains only the 41,000-neuron subset used by the poker
  agent and 3D positions derived from the release's `somaLocation` field.

* `data/` is SYNTHETIC data generated by `tools/build_brain.py` for interface
  testing only. It is not a real brain.

The three.js library vendored in `vendor/` is MIT licensed
(https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js).